		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Grey-skinned, starving woman who trails flowering, thorny vines. Feeds on failed relationships.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 25, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 vine +4 (1d6) or 2 thorns (far) +4 (1d4) or dominate, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Dominate</strong>. One mortal within near WIS 12+ or sahkil controls for 1d10 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Entangling Vines</strong>. Creatures within close, DEX 12+ or entangled for 1 round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
